{"seq":10,"slug":"harmonyos-development","title":"HarmonyOS 开发","stage":"DONE","category":"mobile","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/mobile/harmonyos-development","rating":{"composite":3.95,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.33,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introMarkdown":"# HarmonyOS 开发 简介\n\n华为 HarmonyOS NEXT 是一款面向万物互联时代的全场景分布式操作系统，从内核到框架完全自研，不再兼容 Android 生态。它采用 ArkTS 语言与 ArkUI 声明式框架，提供了全新的应用开发范式。\n\n本知识库系统性地梳理了 HarmonyOS 应用开发的核心技术栈，适用于有一定移动开发经验、希望转型或拓展 HarmonyOS 能力的工程师。内容聚焦 HarmonyOS NEXT（5.0+）版本，不涉及已废弃的兼容模式。\n\n全书共分为四章：\n\n第一章 **ArkTS 语言与 ArkUI 框架**，从 ArkTS 的类型系统和语言特性出发，深入讲解 ArkUI 声明式组件的开发模式，以及状态管理和渲染机制的优化策略。\n\n第二章 **应用架构与 Ability 模型**，系统介绍 Stage 模型下的 Ability 生命周期管理，进程间通信机制，以及基于 HAP/HSP 的模块化工程设计。\n\n第三章 **分布式能力与多设备协同**，涵盖分布式软总线上的数据同步、跨设备任务迁移与流转，以及超级终端场景下的多设备协同编程模型。\n\n第四章 **生态适配与跨平台迁移**，聚焦系统原生 API 集成、从 Android 项目迁移的实战路径，以及性能调优与应用分发的完整流程。\n\n推荐学习路径：先掌握 ArkTS 与 ArkUI 基础，再理解 Stage 模型架构，之后探索分布式能力，最后通过迁移实践巩固全栈能力。有 TypeScript 或 Swift 经验的读者可快速上手 ArkTS；有 Android 经验的读者建议重点关注第四章的迁移指南。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"arkts-and-arkui","title":"ArkTS 语言与 ArkUI 框架","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mobile/harmonyos-development/arkts-and-arkui","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"arkts-language-fundamentals","title":"ArkTS 语言基础与类型系统","url":"/h/mobile/harmonyos-development/arkts-and-arkui/arkts-language-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"arkui-declarative-components","title":"ArkUI 声明式组件开发","url":"/h/mobile/harmonyos-development/arkts-and-arkui/arkui-declarative-components"},{"seq":3,"slug":"state-management-rendering","title":"状态管理与渲染优化","url":"/h/mobile/harmonyos-development/arkts-and-arkui/state-management-rendering"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"app-architecture","title":"应用架构与 Ability 模型","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mobile/harmonyos-development/app-architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"stage-model-abilities","title":"Stage 模型与 Ability 生命周期","url":"/h/mobile/harmonyos-development/app-architecture/stage-model-abilities"},{"seq":2,"slug":"inter-process-communication","title":"进程间通信与 IPC 机制","url":"/h/mobile/harmonyos-development/app-architecture/inter-process-communication"},{"seq":3,"slug":"modular-architecture","title":"模块化架构与 HAP/HSP 设计","url":"/h/mobile/harmonyos-development/app-architecture/modular-architecture"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"distributed-capabilities","title":"分布式能力与多设备协同","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mobile/harmonyos-development/distributed-capabilities","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"distributed-data-sync","title":"分布式数据同步与管理","url":"/h/mobile/harmonyos-development/distributed-capabilities/distributed-data-sync"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cross-device-migration","title":"跨设备迁移与流转","url":"/h/mobile/harmonyos-development/distributed-capabilities/cross-device-migration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"super-device-collaboration","title":"超级终端与多设备协同","url":"/h/mobile/harmonyos-development/distributed-capabilities/super-device-collaboration"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"ecosystem-and-migration","title":"生态适配与跨平台迁移","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mobile/harmonyos-development/ecosystem-and-migration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"native-api-system-services","title":"原生 API 与系统服务集成","url":"/h/mobile/harmonyos-development/ecosystem-and-migration/native-api-system-services"},{"seq":2,"slug":"migration-from-android","title":"从 Android 迁移到 HarmonyOS","url":"/h/mobile/harmonyos-development/ecosystem-and-migration/migration-from-android"},{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-testing-release","title":"性能测试与应用分发","url":"/h/mobile/harmonyos-development/ecosystem-and-migration/performance-testing-release"}]}]}